{
  "env": {
    "CLAUDE_CODE_SUBAGENT_MODEL": "haiku"
  },
  "permissions": {
    "allow": [
      "Bash(npm run *)",
      "Bash(node *)",
      "Edit",
      "Write",
      "Bash(git status)",
      "Bash(git status *)",
      "Bash(git diff)",
      "Bash(git diff *)",
      "Bash(git log)",
      "Bash(git log *)",
      "Bash(git branch)",
      "Bash(git branch --show-current)",
      "Bash(git branch -a)",
      "PowerShell(npm run *)",
      "PowerShell(git status)",
      "PowerShell(git status *)",
      "PowerShell(git diff)",
      "PowerShell(git diff *)",
      "PowerShell(git log)",
      "PowerShell(git log *)",
      "PowerShell(git branch)",
      "PowerShell(git branch --show-current)",
      "PowerShell(git branch -a)"
    ]
  },
  "extraKnownMarketplaces": {
    "ponytail": {
      "source": {
        "source": "github",
        "repo": "DietrichGebert/ponytail"
      }
    },
    "thedotmack": {
      "source": {
        "source": "github",
        "repo": "thedotmack/claude-mem"
      }
    }
  },
  "enabledPlugins": {
    "ponytail@ponytail": true,
    "claude-mem@thedotmack": true
  },
  "$comment": "Socle générique et sûr pour tout projet issu du template : scripts npm, node, édition, lecture git. Push, reset, restore et toute écriture git restent soumis à confirmation. Plugins (ponytail, claude-mem) : marketplaces connues + plugins activés au niveau projet ; chaque poste les installe une fois (voir catalogs/skills-library.json)."
}
